        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana TSRCA4875, Solid Brass ANSI T-Strike for Roller Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nANSI roller catch strike plate normally used on hollow metal frame doors. The Deltana Roller Catch \"T\" Strike Plate is packaged with matching finish mounting screws and available in 7 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-TSRCA4875U-specifications.gif?v=1704354680\" width=\"414\" width=172\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana TSRCA4875 Roller Catch Strike Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-t-strike-for-roller-catch-deltana-tsrca275\"><b>Small Roller Catch T-Strike</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-full-lip-roller-and-ball-catch-strike-deltana-flsp335\"><b>Full Lip Roller Catch Strike</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana TSRCA4875 Roller Catch T-Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
